Some websites attempt to prevent this by automatically logging a suer out if they enter a certain number of incorrect verification codes. This is ineffective in practice because an advanced attacker can even automate this multi-step process by creating macros for Burp Intruder (Turbo Intruder extension can also be used for this purpose).
